\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.  Shall we meet beyond the river,
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0 Where the surges cease to roll?
\par  Where in all the bright forever,
\par  Sorrow ne'er shall press the soul?
\par \i 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Shall we meet, Shall we meet,
\par Shall we meet beyond the river?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Shall we meet beyond the river,
\par Where the surges cease to roll?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.   Shall we meet in that blest harbour,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  When our stormy voyage is o'er?
\par  Shall we meet and cast the anchor
\par  By the fair, celestial shore?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Shall we meet, Shall we meet ...
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Shall we meet, Shall we meet,
\par Shall we meet beyond the river?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Shall we meet beyond the river,
\par Where the surges cease to roll?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Shall we meet in yonder city,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Where the towers of crystal shine?
\par Where the walls are all of jasper,
\par Built by workmanship divine?
\par Shall we meet, Shall we meet ...
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Shall we meet, Shall we meet,
\par Shall we meet beyond the river?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Shall we meet beyond the river,
\par Where the surges cease to roll?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.  Shall we meet with Christ our Saviour,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 When He comes to claim His own?
\par Shall we know His blessed favour,
\par And sit down upon His throne?
\par \pard       Shall we meet, Shall we meet ...
